        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cate Blanchett, Tom Tykwer, Giovanni Ribisi, Katharine Hepburn, Martin Scorsese\n- Works: Heaven (2002 film), The Aviator\n- Topics: acting, film awards\n\nFacts:\n- Cate Blanchett was born on 14 May 1969 and is an Australian actress and theatre director.\n- Heaven is a 2002 romantic thriller film directed by Tom Tykwer and starring Cate Blanchett and Giovanni Ribisi.\n- Cate Blanchett portrayed Katharine Hepburn in Martin Scorsese's 2004 film The Aviator.\n- Cate Blanchett's performance in The Aviator brought her critical acclaim and many accolades, including the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress.\n- Cate Blanchett became the only actor to win an Oscar for portraying another Oscar-winning actor.",
